			"notes": "Regular users want the file ending in `2020-12-10.jar`, the rest are for developers only and won't work.\n\nThis snapshot adds occlusion culling for planar fog, meaning its performance impact in the nether should be drastically reduced. Notable differences from the last official releases of Sodium include a fix for the memory leak affecting speedrunners, a new implementation of the 4.3 chunk renderering backend (from upstream) that works on AMD's proprietary OpenGL driver, and of course the inclusion of planar fog."
		},
